  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "game-description-cbe0aa59-ccdb-45f8-b169-bbea72acce16-0",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Hunting involves locating and pursuing wild animals, and can serve subsistence, livelihood, cultural, or recreational purposes. Its sporting forms emphasize abilities such as tracking, observation, patience, and familiarity with a landscape. Equipment, quarry, customs, and the meaning attached to a successful hunt vary considerably."
    },
    {
      "id": "game-description-cbe0aa59-ccdb-45f8-b169-bbea72acce16-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "This is a broad practice rather than one designed game. Its place in a collection about play concerns the transformation of pursuit into recreation, ritual, or competition, without treating every form of hunting as sport. No single creator, publisher, or release date applies."
    },
